Subject: [PATCH 09/11] Online tag: send tag teams in LoadCard (36); WebUI
 invite checks the partner's code server-side

* LoadCard.MobileUserGroup.tag_teams: every team the card leads or partners, partner_id = partner's pilot id
  (card id), tag_status configurable (OnlineTag.TagStatus, default 0), one entry per team, max 20.
* PreCreateTeam (the invite: partner's user id + invitation code): the code is now checked by the server
  (upstream trusted the WebUI's separate check), no team with yourself, 20-team limit on both cards,
  duplicates refused with Success=false, and the code is one-time by default (OnlineTag.OneTimeInviteCode).
* WebUI sends the code with preCreateTeam.
* New config section CardServerConfig.OnlineTag (SendTagTeams, TagStatus, MaxTeams, OneTimeInviteCode).
